    "body": "## Summary\n\n- carry the authenticated `User` into top-up PaymentIntent creation instead of exposing a caller-supplied raw user ID at the public service boundary\n- reject missing or transient payment actors before Stripe request construction\n- carry the authenticated actor through refund orchestration and keep raw IDs internal to scoped refund persistence\n- reject a missing actor before refund reads touch persistence\n- add negative and positive regression coverage for creation, dispatch and scoped reread\n- update the security contract and active 965-point audit status\n\n## Scope\n\n- 1 commit\n- 9 files\n- +153 / -13\n- base: `4801d2bbaf96720a128ff463217025fffdc0b4d0`\n- head: `5c5ddac291e30976ff34da6e490e3896dfd5a222`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- local and remote tree SHA match: `f1ba36230ebcec4496856598bd4c2dc61173c96f`\n- merge only after all workflows for the exact head SHA are green and review threads are clear",
